From: =?UTF-8?q?Tristan=20M=C3=B5ts?= <tristan@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:48:35 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 11/18] feat(fast-money): scale-to-fit themed board, clear
 total/timer, target setting, compact host rows

- board is a fixed 1060px layout scaled to the screen like the main board and
  uses the theme's fastm colours instead of hard-coded blue/black
- timer and a large TOTAL box sit below the board (no overlap), with 'Target: N'
- win threshold is a room setting (Settings.final_round_win_threshold, default 200)
- host controls: one row per question (answer, pick, reveal, award, status)
- awarding 'No answer' plays the try-again sound instead of flashing the strike X
